# Optional proxy list — one proxy per line. Point the "Proxies (optional)"
# config field at this file, or leave that field empty to connect direct.
#
# Any of these formats parse (lines that don't parse are skipped):
#   host:port
#   host:port:user:pass
#   user:pass@host:port
#   scheme://user:pass@host:port
#
# Uncomment and replace with your own:
# geo.example-proxies.com:12321:myuser:mypass
